@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
title Proposed — Essential representation routes
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

rectangle "Exact committed publication manifest\ncontent / language / layout identity / evidence" as P
rectangle "Eligible web representation" as W
rectangle "Explicit generated PDF work\nexact renderer + publication input identity" as G
rectangle "Independent admitted uploaded PDF\nactual declared language / artifact identity" as U
rectangle "Files usable artifact + protected reference" as F
rectangle "Current link/viewer + mode/language eligibility\ncontrolled exact delivery" as D
P --> W
P --> G
G --> F : actual generation result, not metadata-only success
U --> F : independent upload association, not conversion
W --> D
F --> D
note bottom of D
 No draft, other-language or old-PDF fallback.
 JSON/image/embed and HTTP Accept negotiation are not selected.
end note

@enduml